{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an entrepreneur and build your very own store in the heart of the Balkans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small neighborhood shop and gradually turn it into a large retail chain. Stock the shelves, manage your inventory, serve customers, and keep an eye on your budget. Balance demand, pricing, and expenses to grow a successful business.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIEVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one guarantees the safety of your store, and nothing stops it from being completely looted. Thieves are clever individuals who know how to rob your shop in the best possible way. They may come in groups or act alone in search of better loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of cleaners, stockers, cashiers, and many more will support you in developing your perfect store\u2014and perhaps even take over the entire workload. But beware: there\u2019s no guarantee they won\u2019t quit at any moment if they get tired of you and your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN ONE STORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our city, once your first store is fully developed, you can take on a second one for even greater success and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Included in the Demo:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Buying and managing a store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Purchasing goods to restock the store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Restocking the store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Hiring and firing employees (Janitor and Cashier)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>and much more</u></i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025810?t=1761803511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/c9c546d396f01deb49ae95c3a80c4e81550ddf71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761803511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/d8f4ba4e953d618787ffc4f2fa95f78da4cd811c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761803511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/d8f4ba4e953d618787ffc4f2fa95f78da4cd811c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761803511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an entrepreneur and build your very own store in the heart of the Balkans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small neighborhood shop and gradually turn it into a large retail chain. Stock the shelves, manage your inventory, serve customers, and keep an eye on your budget. Balance demand, pricing, and expenses to grow a successful business.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIEVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one guarantees the safety of your store, and nothing stops it from being completely looted. Thieves are clever individuals who know how to rob your shop in the best possible way. They may come in groups or act alone in search of better loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of cleaners, stockers, cashiers, and many more will support you in developing your perfect store\u2014and perhaps even take over the entire workload. But beware: there\u2019s no guarantee they won\u2019t quit at any moment if they get tired of you and your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1761803511\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/extras_big/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1761803511 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN ONE STORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our city, once your first store is fully developed, you can take on a second one for even greater success and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Included in the Demo:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Buying and managing a store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Purchasing goods to restock the store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Restocking the store</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Hiring and firing employees (Janitor and Cashier)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>and much more</u></i></strong></p>","developers":[" VankoKN05","GalaxyCommunityDEV TEAM"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4016760","name":"Balkan Shop Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025810/558a570199879c64f9b7095bbf0d12b2ecab7a6c/header.jpg?t=1761803511","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Balkan Shop Simulator Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and opera